SOURCELONG:Unearthed Arcana - Artificer	SOURCESHORT:UA	SOURCEWEB:https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/ua	SOURCEDATE:2015-01

Racial Trait ~ Eldritch Cannon	CATEGORY:Internal																						ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Eldritch Cannon ~ Activate Cannon									SOURCEPAGE:PHB 
Activate Cannon	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.EldritchCannonRaceTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:As a Bonus Action, you order the cannon to use the Flamethrower, Force Ballista, or Protector option below; you can direct the cannon to move up to 15 feet before or after that option.	KEY:Eldritch Cannon ~ Activate Cannon																											SOURCEPAGE:UA2 
#
Explosive Cannon	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.EldritchCannonRaceTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Every Eldritch Cannon you create is now more destructive. You gain the following benefits: &nl; Detonate. When your cannon is reduced to 0 Hit Points, you can take a Reaction to command the cannon to detonate if you are within 60 feet of it. Doing so destroys the cannon and forces each creature within 20 feet of it to make a Dexterity saving throw against your spell save DC, taking 3d10 Force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. &nl; Firepower. The cannon’s damage rolls increase by 1d8.	KEY:Eldritch Cannon ~ Explosive Cannon																											SOURCEPAGE:UA2 
Fortified Position	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.EldritchCannonRaceTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:You’re a master at forming well-defended emplacements using your Eldritch Cannon. You gain the following benefits: &nl; Double Firepower. You can now have two cannons at the same time. You can create two with the same Magic action (but not with the same spell slot), and you can activate both of them with the same Bonus Action, ordering them to use the same activation option or different ones. You can’t create a third cannon while you have two. &nl; Shimmering Field Projection. You and your allies have Half Cover while within 10 feet of your Eldritch Cannon.	KEY:Eldritch Cannon ~ Fortified Position																											SOURCEPAGE:UA2 


Racial Trait ~ Steel Defender	CATEGORY:Internal																						ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Steel Defender ~ Immunities|Steel Defender ~ Languages|Steel Defender ~ Steel Bond|Steel Defender ~ Force-Empowered Rend|Steel Defender ~ Repair|Steel Defender ~ Deflect Attack							BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base		SOURCEPAGE:PHB
Immunities	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.SteelDefenderRaceTrait.SpecialQuality	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Immunities to Poison, Charmed, Exhaustion, Poisoned, and Psychic	KEY:Steel Defender ~ Immunities																													SOURCEPAGE:UA
Languages	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.SteelDefenderRaceTrait.SpecialQuality	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Understands the languages you know.	KEY:Steel Defender ~ Languages																													SOURCEPAGE:UA
Steel Bond	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.SteelDefenderRaceTrait.SpecialQuality	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Add your Proficiency Bonus to any ability check or saving throw the defender makes.	KEY:Steel Defender ~ Steel Bond																													SOURCEPAGE:UA
Force-Empowered Rend	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.SteelDefenderRaceTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Melee Attack Roll: Bonus equals your spell attack modifier, reach 5 ft. Hit: 1d8 + 2 plus your Intelligence modifier Force damage.	KEY:Steel Defender ~ Force-Empowered Rend																											SOURCEPAGE:UA
Repair	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.SteelDefenderRaceTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:The defender, or one Construct or object it can see within 5 feet of it, regains a number of Hit Points equal to 2d8 plus your Intelligence modifier.	KEY:Steel Defender ~ Repair			DEFINE:RepairTimes|0				BONUS:VAR|RepairTimes|3																				ASPECT:Name|Repair (%1/day)|RepairTimes		SOURCEPAGE:UA
Deflect Attack	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.SteelDefenderRaceTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Trigger: A creature the defender can see within 5 feet of it makes an attack roll targeting a different creature. Response: The triggering creature makes the attack roll with Disadvantage.	KEY:Steel Defender ~ Deflect Attack																												SOURCEPAGE:UA
#
Arcane Jolt	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.SteelDefenderRaceTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:When either you hit a target with an attack roll using a magic weapon or your Steel Defender hits a target, you can channel magical energy through the strike to create one of the following effects: &nl; Destructive Energy. The target takes an extra 2d6 Force damage. &nl; Restorative Energy. Choose one creature or object you can see within 30 feet of the target. Healing energy flows into the chosen recipient, restoring 2d6 Hit Points to it.	KEY:Steel Defender ~ Arcane Jolt																												SOURCEPAGE:UA
Improved Defender	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:RacialTrait.SteelDefenderRaceTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Your Arcane Jolt and Steel Defender have become more powerful, granting these benefits: &nl; Improved Jolt. The extra damage and healing of your Arcane Jolt both increase to 4d6. &nl; Fortified Defender. Your Steel Defender gains a +2 bonus to Armor Class. &nl; Improved Deflection. Whenever your Steel Defender uses its Deflect Attack, the attacker takes Force damage equal to 1d4 plus your Intelligence modifier.	KEY:Steel Defender ~ Improved Defender																												SOURCEPAGE:UA

Racial Trait ~ Homunculus Servant	CATEGORY:Internal																						ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Homunculus Servant ~ Immunities|Homunculus Servant ~ Language|Homunculus Servant ~ Evasion|Homunculus Servant ~ Magic Bond|Homunculus Servant ~ Force Strike|Homunculus Servant ~ Channel Magic	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Racial		
Immunities	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Racial Traits.HomunculusServantRacialTrait.SpecialQuality	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Poison;Exhaustion, Poisoned.	KEY:Homunculus Servant ~ Immunities																											SOURCEPAGE:UA2
Language	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Racial Traits.HomunculusServantRacialTrait.SpecialQuality	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Telepathy 1 mile (works only with you).	KEY:Homunculus Servant ~ Language						BONUS:VAR|TelepathyRange|5280																					SOURCEPAGE:UA2
Evasion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Racial Traits.HomunculusServantRacialTrait.SpecialQuality	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:If the homunculus is subjected to an effect that allows it to make a Dexterity saving throw to take only half damage, the homunculus instead takes no damage if it succeeds on the save and only half damage if it fails. It can’t use this trait if it has the Incapacitated condition.	KEY:Homunculus Servant ~ Evasion																											SOURCEPAGE:UA2
Magic Bond	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Racial Traits.HomunculusServantRacialTrait.SpecialQuality	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Add the spell level to any ability check or saving throw the homunculus makes.	KEY:Homunculus Servant ~ Magic Bond																											SOURCEPAGE:UA2
Force Strike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Racial Traits.HomunculusServantRacialTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: Bonus equals your spell attack modifier, reach 5 ft. or range 30 ft. Hit: 1d6 plus the spell’s level of Force damage.	KEY:Homunculus Servant ~ Force Strike																											SOURCEPAGE:UA2
Channel Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Racial Traits.HomunculusServantRacialTrait.SpecialAttack	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Channel Magic. Trigger: You cast a spell that has a range of touch while the homunculus is within 120 feet of you. Response: The homunculus delivers the spell through its touch.	KEY:Homunculus Servant ~ Channel Magic						BONUS:VAR|TelepathyRange|5280																					SOURCEPAGE:UA2
